(text "Charger: 500 mA with R1 = 2.4k, TEMP tied low (no NTC). USB-C is a wired snap socket with its own CC resistors, in both housings." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d32109e0-e56d-5fb3-84e9-afeba3ddebcc"))
(text "Protection: VBAT is B+ and OUT+. GND is P-: the cell's minus (BATN) only reaches it through Q1. Never tie BATN to GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 88.90 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9b085025-6c7f-5881-987a-78ae73523fad"))
(text "Super Mini soldered flat by its edge pads; B+/B- on its underside. Keep copper away from under its antenna end." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.40 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cf72e9c7-8577-52ac-84bc-cc7530ff36e4"))
(text "GPIO 1, 4, 10, 11 as in firmware/main/board.h. GPIO 2, 3 stay free: strapping pins. Do not power it over its own USB-C while the battery is connected." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.40 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d2ad607c-3d37-50fa-accc-ad8c7ef042c4"))
(text "Driver: channel B unused. R7 sets the current limit, 0.2 V / R. Use 0 ohm for no limit." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 124.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f9d62733-5b11-5e73-b7d8-379dff369329"))
(text "Encoder: Rollo only. Valve head: leave Q2, R9, R10, R11 and J4 off (DNP). GPIO 5 low = encoder on." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.40 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "26a598e1-579a-5a18-b12a-e8a8e184f083"))
